Package: CompStellation
Title: Interpretable Star Plots for Compositional Ecological Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Kaden", "Muffett", , "kmmuffett@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates interpretable compositional and multidimensional star
    (radar) plots from 'phyloseq' objects or 'vegan'-style community tables
    using 'ggplot2'. Summarizes focal and core taxon relative abundances across
    groups, evaluates core prevalence thresholds, and displays group centers
    across multiple ordination axes simultaneously.
License: AGPL-3
URL: https://github.com/kadenmuffett/CompStellation
BugReports: https://github.com/kadenmuffett/CompStellation/issues
